// Objective - Organelle 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P251482518" "Captured Organelle"
// Description :
"P2828355122" "Examine the Organelle"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3193635469" "The thing's mind reaches out to you."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P2496276584" "The communication has been interrupted"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1035655338" "It's mind withdraws, it's message said."
// InteractActionString :
"P3636212435" "It's talking in your mind..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3483888458" "You learned something"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P33161196" "You defeated the commander and learned from the Hamidon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2710159738" "Amazing! Mental contact with Hamidon Parsalima, the mad genius who became the Hamidon and created the Devouring Earth! Did you get a sample? No, wait, must stay focused. The important thing is that we can not allow the heroes to gain by this. If this 'Zenflower' succeeds in domesticating the Devouring Earth, it will be a disaster for all the evil in the world. And if there is anything mad scientist CAN NOT abide, it is the forces of good profiting from his plans! I will not allow it! <br><br>Fortunately, my interrogation went well. It seems that while Arbiter Daos is concerned, he has no concrete evidence. Indeed, Daos suspects NOTHING of my genius! Or of my true plans to RULE the WORLD! <br><br>Laugh with me! <br><br>RAAH - HA - HA - HA - HA - HAAAAA! <br><br>I don't know if you've noticed but I've been trying a couple different styles of evil laugh. It's hard to pick the right one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2722483078" "I am very close to putting an end to this heroic usurpation of my mad scientific genius, but a problem has occurred. Something has re-awoken many of the Devouring Earth specimens I had you capture, and now they're running riot in my own lab! They could well destroy my work if they are left unchecked.<A HREF={ACCEPT}>{VillainName}, you must help me to subdue the beasts in my lab or else all will be lost.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1495144975" "Help Vernon clean out his lab"
// SendOffString :
"P2183964332" "You'll have to defeat all of the beasts, as well as recover 3 pieces of my work for safe keeping. As you know, I work for Operative Grillo on the Fury project. So, it, ah, isn't just my lab. There are other people there, and they are sort of my co-workers, so it might be good if you could get them out too. I may be mad, but I did just order some boxes of spiderling-scout candy from one of their daughters, and I'll never get them if all of my co-workers are devoured."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4171213629" "Save Vernon's lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P624293966" "You must contain the problem in my lab! And don't forget to save my co-workers or else I'll never get my boxes of spiderling sweets!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P829808461" "How many dull hours did Vernon spend here, inventing mad plans while he spent his life in day-to-day drudgery?"

